  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Assignment (mode ``cascade_rule``) or planned operation (mode ``planning``).\n\n``sink_heat`` is ``null`` in the mode ``planning``: the reduced model of the planning knows\nthe heat used per hour, not its split to the consumers. ``storage_content_kwh`` has one entry\nmore than the other series (content before the first and after every hour).",
  "properties": {
